Psychotests will help you better reveal your personality! Popular psychological tests will reveal your abilities, shortcomings, and personality traits. Properly selected questionnaires will help not only to understand all areas of your life but also to improve their components.

Test collections are divided into categories:
- Intelligence tests;
- Stress and Anxiety;
- Personality;
- Professional Skills;
- Other tests.

Convenient and easy navigation, nice interface, personal progress, dark theme.

Based on the results of the passed tests, the application provides a detailed breakdown and recommendations.

Tests meet modern requirements for psychological methods. A wide range: from professional to entertainment tests. Emotional intelligence, iq test, personality tests, enneagram test, MBTI test, 16personalities, Myers Briggs personality test, color personality test, disorder mental health, a test of mental health, mental disorders tests, mental ill test, mensa iq test, iq scale, mental illness test, mental disorder, eq testing, neuropsychological, personality quiz, psychopath test, borderline personality disorder test, BPD test, MBTI types, personality type test, MBTI personality test, sociopath test, big 5 personality test, personality disorder test, narcissist test, disc personality test, free enneagram test.

The application has a subscription for a month, 3 months, half a year, or one year, which includes:
 - hide ads;
 - access to "Pro" tests;
 - offline access to tests;
 - regular updates (new tests).

More details about the application rules can be found on the page "Terms and Conditions" - https://psychotests-a9589.web.app/terms
Privacy Policy - https://psychotests-a9589.web.app/policy

QiblaCompas Ramadan - your guide to the world of Islam and the Muslim religion. In the appendix you will find for yourself not only historical facts and excerpts, as well as the text of the Koran, but also a guide to prayer times, a complete calendar of Muslim holidays for 2023, and subsequently for the next year. You can also monitor the number of your prayers using a personal tracker. The compass built into the application will point you in the right direction towards Mecca.

Main functionality of the application:
- Prayer times and prayer tracker;
- Prayer times, sunrise and sunset;
- Daily ayat notification;
- Compass to mecca;
- Names of Allah  and much more

